<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine Nov industrial production down to 1.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine Nov industrial production down to 1.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine industrial production fell by 1.3 percent in November after growing 17.5 percent in October, the Statistics Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> UKRAINE INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION  NOV 96  OCT 96   NOV 95</p>
<p> mth/mth change (percent)	 -1.3    +17.5    -4.3</p>
<p> year/year change (percent)     -6.7    -9.5     -7.4</p>
<p>Except for October and March, Ukrainian industrial output has declined every month this year.</p>
<p>The overall decline in production was 1.9 percent since the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>The government has forecast industrial growth of 1.8 percent in 1997.</p>
<p>--Yuri Kulikov, Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
